{"_v":1,"id":"annie-2012","cs":65,"rc":9,"bd":{"positive":3,"mixed":5,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Jennifer Farrar","o":"Associated Press","s":81,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/theater_dance/review-bullying-and-climate-change-entwine-in-clever-if-there-is-i-havent-found-it-yet/2012/09/20/154bd592-0387-11e2-9132-f2750cd65f97_story.html","d":"2012-09-20","q":"Whether this family can pull themselves out of their troubled waters is another matter, but they're worth rooting for in this complex, compelling drama."},{"cn":"Peter Marks","o":"The Washington Post","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/theater_dance/for-annie-actress-on-broadway-the-sun-has-come-out/2012/11/08/69514322-29e1-11e2-aaa5-ac786110c486_story.html","d":"2012-11-08","q":"So it is with this handsome revival, infinitely superior to the previous Broadway incarnation, a woefully bedraggled 1997 staging with Nell Carter as orphanage monster Miss Hannigan that ran for only 239 performances."},{"cn":"Jesse Green","o":"Vulture","s":77,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.vulture.com/2012/11/theater-review-annie.html","d":"2012-11-05","q":"You will cry, or consider crying, if you have a functioning amygdala."},{"cn":"Marilyn Stasio","o":"Variety","s":65,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2012/legit/reviews/the-outgoing-tide-2-1117948793/","d":"2012-11-08","q":"The new production of 'Annie' is a perfectly serviceable revival that hits all the right notes without adding any surprising new harmonies to the familiar score."},{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/theater/reviews/annie-starring-katie-finneran-at-the-palace-theater.html","d":"2012-11-08","q":"This version, which flirts with shadows, moves more shakily."},{"cn":"Mark Kennedy","o":"Associated Press","s":61,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://bigstory.ap.org/article/review-revival-annie-wont-make-lizards-leap","d":"2012-11-08","q":"It is an odd thing indeed to watch Sandy get a huge ovation from New Yorkers."},{"cn":"Terry Teachout","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":61,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.wsj.com/articles/SB10001424127887324735104578147043471091112","d":"2012-11-09","q":"The new production of 'Annie' is a slick, professionally executed revival that hits all the familiar marks without adding anything particularly fresh or memorable to the mix."},{"cn":"David Rooney","o":"The Hollywood Reporter","s":43,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/annie-theater-review-390315/","d":"2012-11-09","q":"Returning to Broadway almost three decades later, this enduring ode to optimism remains a sterling example of expert musical-theater craftsmanship."},{"cn":"Joe Dziemianowicz","o":"New York Daily News","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.nydailynews.com/2012/11/08/theater-review-annie-on-broadway/","d":"2012-11-09","q":"If this take seldom crosses the line into something must-see special (it doesn’t), even a simply good production of “Annie” offers rewards."}],"au":{"score":81,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"mz":{"s":72,"c":458,"sr":3.6},"ss":{"s":86,"c":795},"th":{"s":76.1,"c":71},"rd":{"s":63,"c":571,"tp":536,"sent":{"enthusiastic":0.04,"positive":0.33,"mixed":0.09,"negative":0.42,"neutral":0.11}}}},"hi":"/images/shows/annie-2012/hero.webp","ta":"1568 Broadway, New York, NY 10036","pd":"2012-10-03","ca":[{"n":"Lilla Crawford","r":"Annie"},{"n":"Katie Finneran","r":"Miss Hannigan"},{"n":"Anthony Warlow","r":"Oliver Warbucks"},{"n":"J. Elaine Marcos","r":"Lily St. Regis"},{"n":"Brynn O'Malley","r":"Grace Farrell"},{"n":"Clarke Thorell","r":"Rooster Hannigan"},{"n":"Ashley Blanchet","r":"Star to Be"},{"n":"Jane Blass","r":"Apple Seller"},{"n":"Casey","r":"Stray Dog"},{"n":"Jeremy Davis","r":"Bundles"},{"n":"Madi Rae DiPietro","r":"July"},{"n":"Merwin Foard","r":"F.D.R."},{"n":"Joel Hatch","r":"Drake"},{"n":"Georgi James","r":"Pe